{"tag_name":"v1.7.317-6e3ebc5","html_url":"https://github.com/eachann1024/goose-note/releases/tag/v1.7.317-6e3ebc5","releaseNotes":"- 首次打开先选一只点阵形象，侧栏设置入口显示所选形象的头像，设置「外观」里可随时更换。\n- Git 同步改为可选模块：设置里可开关，没装 git 时不显示 Git 页签，关闭后不再后台同步。\n- 长文档与大表格更跟手：大表只挂可见行，多选移动、块拖拽和表格拖选不再整页重排；删除、关闭标签与移动笔记只淡出真正消失的项。\n- 欢迎短片窗口固定 16:9 并可静音，短片体积减少约 28%。\n- 中文界面改名为「思绪 · Thinkly」，英文显示 Thinkly；数据目录、安装包文件名和自动更新仍沿用 Goose Note，升级后笔记和设置不受影响。\n- 新增日语界面：设置里可选「日本語」，系统语言为日语时自动切换；菜单、速记小窗、AI 与各类提示均已翻译。\n- 分栏内容在分享长图和卡片、导出 Word 中保持左右并排；从其他编辑器粘贴带分栏的 Markdown 会还原分栏，AI 也能读到栏内的标题和正文。","publishedAt":"2026-10-18T12:46:36Z","assets":[{"name":"Goose.Note-1.7.317-arm64.dmg","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/eachann1024/goose-notes/releases/download/v1.7.317-6e3ebc5/Goose.Note-1.7.317-arm64.dmg","sha256":"ff64a0817d5f1fcfa6abf193359400b352d5c90ac58715a81cfb2a6955256c3b"},{"name":"Goose.Note-1.7.317.dmg","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/eachann1024/goose-notes/releases/download/v1.7.317-6e3ebc5/Goose.Note-1.7.317.dmg","sha256":"8e0dc776ad33b021671f109d8c0d6129e63704817b0c86d58d75f2571feb3730"},{"name":"Goose.Note-1.7.317-arm64-mac.zip","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/eachann1024/goose-notes/releases/download/v1.7.317-6e3ebc5/Goose.Note-1.7.317-arm64-mac.zip","sha256":"3345260213c2fc0f2c9f87a6fcb552b4134cb3622251c906d671dc751f4c007f"},{"name":"Goose.Note-1.7.317-mac.zip","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/eachann1024/goose-notes/releases/download/v1.7.317-6e3ebc5/Goose.Note-1.7.317-mac.zip","sha256":"04d9e7d880e691c0ba6534a82f2ad1413531d790cb7f7e1fbc648a805129d7c9"},{"name":"Goose.Note-1.7.317-x64-setup.exe","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/eachann1024/goose-notes/releases/download/v1.7.317-6e3ebc5/Goose.Note-1.7.317-x64-setup.exe","sha256":"73b1dae5595b1f9efff3d9773a54b9e26ed817cfa1172577025fcc130f02835c"},{"name":"Goose.Note-1.7.317-arm64-setup.exe","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/eachann1024/goose-notes/releases/download/v1.7.317-6e3ebc5/Goose.Note-1.7.317-